{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45849","headline":"刘相公见访 · 贯休","name":"刘相公见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千骑拥朱轮，香尘岂是尘。\n如何补衮服，来看衲衣人。\n庄叟因先觉，空王有宿因。\n对花无俗态，爱竹见天真。\n欹枕松窗迥，题墙道意新。\n戒师慙匪什，都讲更胜询。\n桃熟多红璺，茶香有碧筋。\n高宗多不寐，终是梦中人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}